## Third-party code included in this repository

### flutter_math_fork/

A vendored, modified copy of the `flutter_math_fork` package
(https://github.com/simpleclub/flutter_math), itself a fork of `flutter_math`
(https://github.com/znjameswu/flutter_math). Its own LICENSE -- the Apache
License 2.0 -- is kept unchanged at `flutter_math_fork/LICENSE`, and the
directory stays under it rather than under this repository's own copyright.

Two licenses apply inside that directory, and the files say which:

  · 48 files ported from KaTeX (https://github.com/KaTeX/KaTeX) carry their own
    MIT notice, Copyright (c) 2013-2019 Khan Academy and other contributors and
    Copyright (c) 2020 znjameswu. Those notices are upstream's and were left
    exactly as they were found; MIT requires only that they be retained.

  · The remaining 136 files carry the Apache 2.0 header naming the flutter_math
    authors and the flutter_math_fork maintainers as the copyright holders. 61
    of them, the ones actually changed here, add a `Modifications copyright 2026
    wilinz.` line as section 4(b) requires.

Modifications: `MathController` is exported from the public library and its
null-safety was corrected so an unset AST throws instead of being dereferenced;
selection sanitising accepts a nullable AST. The rest is mechanical -- string-form
`part of` directives, redundant `this.` removed, missing `@override`, unnamed
`library;` -- to satisfy the analyzer on current Flutter SDKs.

### Platform scaffolding

`android/`, `ios/`, `macos/`, `linux/` and `windows/` contain the runner and
plugin-registrant files generated by the Flutter tool, Copyright 2013 The Flutter
Authors, licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License. `packages/aircalc_native/lib/
src/bindings.dart` is generated by `package:ffigen` from `src/aircalc.h`. These
are left as generated and carry no header of this project's.

